@startuml seq-mf05-vnpay-payment
title sd MF-05a: Client Pays Service Fee or Posting Fee via VNPay Gateway
autonumber
hide footbox
actor "Client Company User" as CL
participant "Web App (Billing Page)" as FE
participant "VnPayPaymentEndpoints" as API
participant "VnPayPaymentCommandHandlers" as H
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "VNPay Sandbox Gateway" as VP
actor "Platform Admin" as AD
CL -> FE : Click Pay with VNPay on unpaid ServiceFee / PostingFee
FE -> API : POST /api/v1/payments/vnpay (TargetType, TargetId)
API -> H : Send(CreateVnPayPaymentCommand)
H -> DB : Verify fee is payable & insert OnlinePayment (PENDING, TxnRef)
H --> API : Return signed VNPay URL (HMAC-SHA512)
API --> FE : 200 OK (PaymentUrl)
FE -> VP : Redirect browser to VNPay Checkout & complete payment
VP -> API : GET /api/v1/payments/vnpay/ipn (Signed callback query)
API -> H : Send(ConfirmVnPayPaymentCommand)
alt Invalid HMAC Signature / Order Not Found / Wrong Amount
H --> VP : Return RspCode 97 / 01 / 04
else Valid Callback & Payment Succeeded
H -> DB : Claim OnlinePayment -> PROCESSING
H -> DB : Record Fee -> PAID (Ref: VNPAY-TxnNo) & OnlinePayment -> SUCCEEDED
H --> AD : Send real-time notification: VNPay payment received
H --> VP : Return RspCode 00 (Confirm Success)
end
VP --> FE : Redirect browser to /client/billing/vnpay-return
FE -> API : GET /api/v1/payments/vnpay/return (Idempotent verify)
API --> FE : 200 OK (OnlinePaymentResultDto)
FE --> CL : Display Payment Receipt
@enduml
